    "format": "<template><section class=\"rovo-panel\"><h2>Willkommen bei Rovo</h2><p>Alle wichtigen Funktionen auf einen Blick.</p><small>Robotic Observation and Voice Operator</small><div class=\"rovo-eyes\"><i></i><i></i></div><p>Augen: Browseranimation. Gerätewerte: siehe Status.</p><p v-if=\"result\" role=\"status\"><strong>{{result.status}}</strong> · {{result.spoken_reply}}</p><p v-if=\"snapshot.offline\">Backend offline – Status unbekannt.</p><p v-if=\"snapshot.simulation\" style=\"color:#f4cd77\">SIMULATION – keine Hardwaremessung</p><p v-if=\"age>8\" style=\"color:#ff8c8c\">Status veraltet. Verbindung prüfen.</p><details><summary>Status und Fähigkeiten</summary><pre>{{JSON.stringify(snapshot,null,2)}}</pre></details><details v-if=\"result\"><summary>Ergebnisdaten</summary><pre>{{JSON.stringify(result.data,null,2)}}</pre></details></section></template>\n<script>\nexport default{\ndata(){return{text:\"\",snapshot:{offline:true},result:null,now:Date.now(),clock:null,faces:[\"NEUTRAL\",\"LISTENING\",\"THINKING\",\"TALKING\",\"HAPPY\",\"CURIOUS\",\"SLEEPY\",\"SURPRISED\",\"ERROR\",\"SAD\",\"ANGRY\",\"CONFUSED\",\"LAUGHING\",\"WINK\",\"BLINK\",\"LOVE\"]}},\ncomputed:{age(){return this.snapshot.updated_at_utc?(this.now-Date.parse(this.snapshot.updated_at_utc))/1000:999}},\nwatch:{msg:{deep:true,handler(m){const p=m?.payload;if(!p)return;if(p.schema===\"rovo.status.v1\"||p.offline)this.snapshot=p;if(p.schema===\"rovo.result.v1\"||p.spoken_reply)this.result=p}}},\nmounted(){this.clock=setInterval(()=>this.now=Date.now(),1000)},unmounted(){clearInterval(this.clock)},\nmethods:{cmd(type,args={}){this.send({payload:{type,args}})},submit(){if(this.text.trim()){this.cmd(\"text\",{text:this.text});this.text=\"\"}}}}\n</script>\n<style>.rovo-panel{padding:14px;color:#e7f1fa}.rovo-panel pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px}.rovo-panel .v-btn{margin:6px}.rovo-eyes{display:flex;gap:30px;justify-content:center;background:#070e17;padding:35px;margin:22px auto;border-radius:24px;max-width:360px}.rovo-eyes i{width:95px;height:65px;background:#39d6c8;border-radius:24px;animation:rovo-blink 4.7s infinite}@keyframes rovo-blink{0%,94%,100%{transform:scaleY(1)}96%{transform:scaleY(.08)}}</style>"
